Z||000000||theogre||05-19-2001||12:19 PM||||Ogre is in. <P>Got home yesterday.<P>... I'm not even going to try to catch up all the old postings right away... If there is still something that someone wants me to read, please move it up then Email me. Otherwise I probably won't get to it if it's more than a couple days old already.<P>Preliminary results are no more cancer found.... That's very good but I'm still waiting on the final report to come back. I should get that next week.<P>Pain wise I'm doing amazingly well. To Well almost. I keep waiting for the other boot to drop if you know what I mean. Maybe it did and I went between the treads. That would be nice.<P>Thanks for all the support on the previous notes threads. It helped considerably. <P>Have fun.<P>------------------<BR><I><B>Screamin Yellow Zonkers... If it's Screamin and Yellow, I ain't eatin it.</B></I>||||reg||10
