Z||000004||2xsess||05-19-2001||02:29 PM||||Ogre, I have great hope for you , My wife and I just took part in Relay for life, an American Cancer society sponsored fund raiser. I met some 31 year survivors of cancer, if a mere mortal can beat it I know an Ogre can do it.<BR>To quote that crazy guy from waterboy<BR>"You can do it!"<BR>Seriously, I'm glad to here you got good news, I hope it stays that way. You're in my thoughts and prayers.<P>Jeff<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Sage||05-19-2001||03:11 PM||||Glad, very glad, to hear things went well.  Life's hard enough without abnormal monkey's jumping on your back!<P>Hoping that things only get better from here and that in a year you will be saying,"cancer?...what cancer?"<P>Good tidings to you!||||reg||1
