Z||000007||Jay||05-19-2001||07:16 PM||||Ogre, that's great news, I didn't even realize you had this battle.  Sometimes we get so caught up in our own problems we don't take the time to look around and help out others.  I think I speak for all of us when I say that we all look forward to many, many years of your wisdom.  The big C has hit my family vary closely, on several occassions, but one thing that I've come to realize is that alot of the time it is ones outlook and positivity that helps in the process.  "If you have the faith of a mustard seed, you can tell this mountain to get up and be moved, and it will be so!"  We all appreciate your knowledge and help.  Keep us in the loop!<P>------------------<BR>Jay<BR>1986 Northstar GT<BR>www.members.home.net/jaygrande||||reg||1
